#### 7. Assertion Roulette
**Catalog ref:** testsmells.org — *Assertion Roulette*
**Test:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (line 69) — same test as above
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(247.50m, order.TotalAmount);   // no message
Assert.AreEqual(22.28m, order.TaxAmount);      // no message
Assert.AreEqual(269.78m, order.GrandTotal);    // no message
```
**Problem:** 3 assertions with no failure messages. A red build only shows `Assert.AreEqual failed. Expected:<X>. Actual:<Y>` — which property failed?
**Fix:** Add messages:
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual(expectedSubtotal, order.TotalAmount, "Subtotal mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedTax, order.TaxAmount, "Tax mismatch");
Assert.AreEqual(expectedGrandTotal, order.GrandTotal, "Grand total mismatch");
```

